      "writtenOn": "2023-07-26T20:39:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NFC stack has a bunch of these usages which were added maybe before ActivityLifeCycleCallbacks.\n\nBut, even with ActivityLifeCycleCallbacks, we do use isResumed() to get the current state when the app registers an activity for NFC operation (See [here](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/nfc/NfcActivityManager.java;l\u003d121?q\u003dNfcActivityManage\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main))",
      "parentUuid": "021a9509_6e05be73",
      "revId": "1250f17dffab41880b2f7c4b78d9754a83dab84a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
