      "writtenOn": "2023-07-26T20:49:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Normally one should register the callback and cache the last observed state, which can be used to implement `isResumed` locally.\n\nMy understanding is that normally usage of existing APIs is preferred to adding new ones to the surface, so I\u0027m wondering if there is some blocker here.",
